        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCBOR, Clear Crystal Bordeaux Knob with Arc Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bordeaux Knob with Arc Rose is a transitional styled crystal knob--a popular choice for designers on the cutting edge. This Clear Crystal Bordeaux Knob with Arc Roseset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit most standard pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur ARCBOR Arc Rosette with Crystal Bordeaux Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Clear Crystal Bordeaux Knobset with Arc Short Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.10\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCBOR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262391\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCBOR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
