                "description": "The Bordeaux Knob with Arc Rose is a transitional styled crystal knob--a popular choice for designers on the cutting edge. This Clear Crystal Bordeaux Knob with Arc Roseset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit most standard pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
